1. Any pattern with rotational symmetry is completely physically incapable of drifting in a specific direction! It **must** remain perfectly stationary at the center of the board (or explode evenly). This guarantees we won't get any fake "puffer" false positives!
2. If it does produce a stream of gliders, it will shoot them out symmetrically in beautiful 2-way, 3-way, or 6-way bursts.

It's churning through 100,000 symmetrically enforced trials right now. I'm waiting on the results!


